they asked Jeeves what to do.

00:00:38.968 --> 00:00:40.534
Yeah, it's clear
they're in trouble,

00:00:40.534 --> 00:00:42.934
because when you type "Google"
into Google Translator,

00:00:42.934 --> 00:00:44.868
it comes back as Yahoo!

00:00:46.834 --> 00:00:48.300
Yep, things are tense
at the company.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:50.100
If you type a word into Google,
it just says,

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:52.267
"Autofill the rest yourself,
you lazy bastard."

00:00:52.267 --> 00:00:54.334
And you go, "That's not..."

00:00:54.334 --> 00:00:56.601
But don't worry -- Google has
a plan to turn things around.

00:00:56.601 --> 00:00:58.200
As we speak,
they're telling investors,

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:01.534
